  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00522",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“那么，请你暂时忍耐些吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Well then, please bear with it for a while.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00522",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "要坚持到大网篮的家伙们回来。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "You have to hold out until the men with the big rope basket come back.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00522",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "我可是饱尝辛酸喽，和那些人做的荒唐事比较起来，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I have had my share of suffering, you know, and compared with the outrageous things those people have done,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00522",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "你可没有发牢骚的道理吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "you really have no reason to complain, do you?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00522",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "而且我还要付给你住宿费呢……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Besides, I am even going to pay you lodging expenses...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00522",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "不过，只有我大致推算的实际费用……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Though only the actual cost as I roughly calculate it...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00522",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "可以吧……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "That is all right, isn't it...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00522",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "当然可以咯！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Of course it is all right!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00522",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "……本来嘛应该不付钱的，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "...Strictly speaking, I should not have to pay at all,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00522",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "但这就不算和你两清了，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "but then that would not settle things between you and me,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00522",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "所以，我硬是要放些钱给你的。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "so I insist on leaving you some money.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
